{
  "id": "ACT.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Bienzedi 19",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi Apolo mu Kolinto, Paulo wakalua ku Efeso, mumane kuhita mu nseke ya ku mikuna, wakasanganamu bayidi bakuabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakabakonka ne, Nuakangata Nyuma Muimpe hanuakitabusha, anyi? Bakamuambila ne, Nasha, katuakunvua ne, Nyuma Muimpe udiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabakonka kabidi ne, Bakanubatiza mu dibatiza kai? Bakamba ne, Mu dibatiza dia Yone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo wakamba ne, Yone wakadi ubatiza bantu ne dibatiza dia kukudimuna kua mitshima wambila bantu ne, Mbimpe bia nuenu kuitabusha ulualua ku nyima kuanyi, au udi Yesu mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvuabo dî edi, bakabatijibua mu dina dia Mukelenge Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabatentekesha Paulo bianza ha mitu habo, Nyuma Muimpe wakabahuekela; bakabanga kuakula mu miaku mikuabo, bamba bualu bua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu aba bonso bakadi bu dikumi ne babidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo wakabuela mu nsunagoga, wakadi ujukuila bantu dî ngondo isatu, wakulangana nʼabo bua kubitabushisha malu a bukelenge bua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bakakolesha bakuabo mitshima yabo, hakahidiabo, bamba mei mabi bua Nshila wa Nzambi ku mesu kua bantu, wakumuka kudibo, wakumusha bayidi munkatshi muabo, wakadi uyisha ku dituku ku difuku mu ekola wa Tulano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu ebu buakenjibua tô bidimu bibidi, nunku bonso bakadi bashikama mu Asia bakunvua dî dia Mukelenge, Bena Yuda ne Bena Gelika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakenza malu makole a kukema ku bianza bia Paulo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku bakatuadila basame matuaya ne bitambala biakadiye nʼabi hamʼbidi, mabedi akumuka kudibo, ne nyuma mibi yakumuka munda muabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bakuabo bendakanyi ba Bena Yuda, batempeshanganyi ba mbuku, bakatela kabidi mua kubikilabo dina dia Mukelenge Yesu ha bakadi ne nyuma mibi munda, bamba ne, Ndi nkutshihisha mu dina dia Yesu udi Paulo wamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana muanda matekete ba Muena Yuda dina diandi Sekua, muakuidi mimene wa Nzambi, mbakadi benza nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma mubi wakabakudimuna ne, Ndi mumanye Yesu, ndi mumanye bua Paulo kadi nuenu mbanganyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakadi ne nyuma mubi munda wakabuhukila, wakubatamba bubidi buabo, wakabatekesha; bakanyema mu nsubu muakadibo, butaka ne batahika mputa hamʼbidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu ebu buakadi bumanyibua kudi bonso, ne Bena Yuda ne Bena Gelika, bakadi bashikama mu Efeso; buowa buakakuata buonso buabo, dina dia Mukelenge Yesu diakadi ditumbishibua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba bungi kabidi bakadi bitabushe diambedi bakadi balua, batonda basokolola malu abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena matempu ba bungi bakasangisha mikanda yabo, bakayosha ku mesu kua bantu bonso. Bakabala mushinga wai, bakausangana muikale bituha bia argent mbombo itanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku dî dia Nzambi diakadiundadiunda bikole, diakatamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashika malu â, Paulo wakahangidisha bua kuhitshila mu Makedonia ne Akaya bua kuyeye ku Yelushalema, wamba ne, Hangikalaku, bundi nʼabu mbua kuya kumona Lomo kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatumeye babidi ba mu bakadi bamukuatshisha, Timote ne Elasto, ku Makedonia, yeye nkayandi wakashala mu Asia tshituha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku au diyoyo dia bungi diakabika bualu bua Nshila wa Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu mukuabo wakadiku, dina diandi Demetelio, wakadi biandi mutudi wa biamu bia argent, yeye wakadi wenza tusubu tua argent tufuanyikisha bu tshitendelelu tshia Atemise, wakadi uha batudi bakuabo mudimu wa bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabasangisha ne bakuabo bakadi ne mudimu wabo muomumue, wakabambila ne, Bana betu, nudi bamanye ne, Ku mudimu eu nkutudi tuhetela biuma bietu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nudi nutangila, nudi nunvua ne, Nasha mu Efeso nkayamu, kadi mu luseke luonso lua Asia, anu tuaba tukese tudi tushala, Paulo eu wakitabushisha bantu ba bungi wakabakudimusha mitshima yabo, wamba ne, Nzambi idi nuenza ne bianza kayena Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuena anu bualu ebu bua kutshina ne, Lumu lua mudimu wetu ludi luamba kulua lubi nkayalu, kadi bua ntempelo wa nzambi mukashi munene Atemise neabadibue ne, Ntshianana, ne bua yeye neumushibue ku butumbi buandi, ngudi bantu bonso ba mu Asia ne ba ha buloba bonso batendelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvuabo dî adi, bakûlangana ne tshishi, bakadi bela mbila ne, Atemise wa Bena Efeso ke udi munene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musoko wakûla tente ne diyoyo; hakakuatabo Gayo ne Alistâko, bantu ba ku Makedonia, bafidi ba Paulo ku luendu luandi, bakanyemena hohamue mu muaba wa tshitangidilu tshia malu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakasua Paulo kubuela muakadi bantu aba, bayidi kabakitabusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu banene bakuabo ba mu Asia, balunda bandi, bakamutumina dî bakadi bamusengelela ne, Kudibueledi mu muaba au wa tshitangidilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuabo bakadi bela dî dikuabo, bakuabo dî dikuabo; musumba wonso wakadi anu diyoyo; ba bungi kabakamanya bualu buakadibo bunguila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakasungula Alesandelo mu musumba wabo, Bena Yuda bakamutuma ku mpala. Alesandelo wakabahoha tshianza, wakamba kudividila ku mesu kua bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi hakamanyabo ne, Yeye udi Muena Yuda, buonso buabo bakela mbila ne di dimue tô bituha bia diba bibidi ne, Atemise wa Bena Efeso ke udi munene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuholesha mufundi wa musoko musumba wa bantu, wakabambila ne, Nuenu Bena Efeso, muntu kai udiku udi kai mumanye ne, Musoko wa Bena Efeso udi mulami wa tshitendelelu tshia Atemise munene, ne wa tshifuanyikishi tshiandi tshiakahona tshifume kudi Yupita? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bantu kabena bamanye mua kudiula dî edi, mbimpe bia nuenu nushikame talala, kanuenji bualu lubilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu nuakulua kunoko ne bantu aba, kabai banze kunyenga bintu bia mu bitemielelu, kabai banze kuhenda nzambi wetu mukashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Demetelio ne bena mudimu nʼandi, bikalabo ne muntu tshilumbu, matuku a kulumbulula adiku ne balumbuludi badiku, baye kubandanganaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi binuakeba bunga bualu, nebabushikishe mu disangisha didi dijalama ne mikenshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, tudi mua kubandibua bua diyoyo dia lelu, bua kadi ne bualu buadi, katuena bamanye mua kuamba budi musumba eu mungele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakambeye nunku, wakamuangalasha disangisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
